{"source":"tts","voice":"piper it_IT-serena-medium","durationSec":72.492,"sentences":[{"text":"Sono Ginevra de' Benci, di Firenze.","start":0,"end":2.159,"words":[{"w":"Sono","start":0,"end":0.327},{"w":"Ginevra","start":0.327,"end":0.851},{"w":"de","start":0.851,"end":1.047},{"w":"Benci","start":1.047,"end":1.44},{"w":"di","start":1.44,"end":1.636},{"w":"Firenze","start":1.636,"end":2.159}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Mio padre era Amerigo de' Benci, un ricco banchiere.","start":2.609,"end":5.547,"words":[{"w":"Mio","start":2.609,"end":2.844},{"w":"padre","start":2.844,"end":3.197},{"w":"era","start":3.197,"end":3.432},{"w":"Amerigo","start":3.432,"end":3.902},{"w":"de","start":3.902,"end":4.078},{"w":"Benci","start":4.078,"end":4.431},{"w":"un","start":4.431,"end":4.607},{"w":"ricco","start":4.607,"end":4.959},{"w":"banchiere","start":4.959,"end":5.547}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Leonardo da Vinci mi ha ritratta quando ero giovane, tra il 1474 e il 1478.","start":5.997,"end":12.812,"words":[{"w":"Leonardo","start":5.997,"end":6.826},{"w":"da","start":6.826,"end":7.102},{"w":"Vinci","start":7.102,"end":7.654},{"w":"mi","start":7.654,"end":7.931},{"w":"ha","start":7.931,"end":8.207},{"w":"ritratta","start":8.207,"end":9.036},{"w":"quando","start":9.036,"end":9.681},{"w":"ero","start":9.681,"end":10.049},{"w":"giovane","start":10.049,"end":10.786},{"w":"tra","start":10.786,"end":11.154},{"w":"il","start":11.154,"end":11.43},{"w":"1474","start":11.43,"end":11.891},{"w":"e","start":11.891,"end":12.075},{"w":"il","start":12.075,"end":12.351},{"w":"1478","start":12.351,"end":12.812}],"paragraph":0},{"text":"Proprio nel 1474 mi sposai con Luigi Niccolini.","start":13.712,"end":17.381,"words":[{"w":"Proprio","start":13.712,"end":14.336},{"w":"nel","start":14.336,"end":14.649},{"w":"1474","start":14.649,"end":15.039},{"w":"mi","start":15.039,"end":15.273},{"w":"sposai","start":15.273,"end":15.819},{"w":"con","start":15.819,"end":16.132},{"w":"Luigi","start":16.132,"end":16.6},{"w":"Niccolini","start":16.6,"end":17.381}],"paragraph":1},{"text":"Forse questo ritratto ricorda quel momento, o forse il mio fidanzamento.","start":17.831,"end":21.673,"words":[{"w":"Forse","start":17.831,"end":18.155},{"w":"questo","start":18.155,"end":18.534},{"w":"ritratto","start":18.534,"end":19.021},{"w":"ricorda","start":19.021,"end":19.454},{"w":"quel","start":19.454,"end":19.725},{"w":"momento","start":19.725,"end":20.158},{"w":"o","start":20.158,"end":20.266},{"w":"forse","start":20.266,"end":20.591},{"w":"il","start":20.591,"end":20.753},{"w":"mio","start":20.753,"end":20.97},{"w":"fidanzamento","start":20.97,"end":21.673}],"paragraph":1},{"text":"Dietro di me vedi un cespuglio di ginepro.","start":22.573,"end":24.559,"words":[{"w":"Dietro","start":22.573,"end":22.904},{"w":"di","start":22.904,"end":23.046},{"w":"me","start":23.046,"end":23.188},{"w":"vedi","start":23.188,"end":23.424},{"w":"un","start":23.424,"end":23.566},{"w":"cespuglio","start":23.566,"end":24.039},{"w":"di","start":24.039,"end":24.181},{"w":"ginepro","start":24.181,"end":24.559}],"paragraph":2},{"text":"Non è un caso: la parola ginepro somiglia al mio nome, Ginevra, e il ginepro era anche un simbolo di virtù.","start":25.009,"end":31.255,"words":[{"w":"Non","start":25.009,"end":25.249},{"w":"è","start":25.249,"end":25.369},{"w":"un","start":25.369,"end":25.549},{"w":"caso","start":25.549,"end":25.85},{"w":"la","start":25.85,"end":26.03},{"w":"parola","start":26.03,"end":26.45},{"w":"ginepro","start":26.45,"end":26.931},{"w":"somiglia","start":26.931,"end":27.471},{"w":"al","start":27.471,"end":27.651},{"w":"mio","start":27.651,"end":27.892},{"w":"nome","start":27.892,"end":28.192},{"w":"Ginevra","start":28.192,"end":28.672},{"w":"e","start":28.672,"end":28.793},{"w":"il","start":28.793,"end":28.973},{"w":"ginepro","start":28.973,"end":29.453},{"w":"era","start":29.453,"end":29.693},{"w":"anche","start":29.693,"end":30.054},{"w":"un","start":30.054,"end":30.234},{"w":"simbolo","start":30.234,"end":30.714},{"w":"di","start":30.714,"end":30.895},{"w":"virtù","start":30.895,"end":31.255}],"paragraph":2},{"text":"Se giri la tavola, sul retro trovi un rametto di ginepro dentro una corona di alloro e di palma, con un motto in latino: «Virtutem forma decorat».","start":32.155,"end":40.514,"words":[{"w":"Se","start":32.155,"end":32.333},{"w":"giri","start":32.333,"end":32.629},{"w":"la","start":32.629,"end":32.807},{"w":"tavola","start":32.807,"end":33.222},{"w":"sul","start":33.222,"end":33.459},{"w":"retro","start":33.459,"end":33.815},{"w":"trovi","start":33.815,"end":34.171},{"w":"un","start":34.171,"end":34.349},{"w":"rametto","start":34.349,"end":34.823},{"w":"di","start":34.823,"end":35.001},{"w":"ginepro","start":35.001,"end":35.475},{"w":"dentro","start":35.475,"end":35.89},{"w":"una","start":35.89,"end":36.127},{"w":"corona","start":36.127,"end":36.542},{"w":"di","start":36.542,"end":36.72},{"w":"alloro","start":36.72,"end":37.135},{"w":"e","start":37.135,"end":37.253},{"w":"di","start":37.253,"end":37.431},{"w":"palma","start":37.431,"end":37.787},{"w":"con","start":37.787,"end":38.024},{"w":"un","start":38.024,"end":38.202},{"w":"motto","start":38.202,"end":38.558},{"w":"in","start":38.558,"end":38.736},{"w":"latino","start":38.736,"end":39.151},{"w":"Virtutem","start":39.151,"end":39.684},{"w":"forma","start":39.684,"end":40.04},{"w":"decorat","start":40.04,"end":40.514}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"Te lo traduco: «la bellezza adorna la virtù».","start":40.964,"end":43.576,"words":[{"w":"Te","start":40.964,"end":41.151},{"w":"lo","start":41.151,"end":41.337},{"w":"traduco","start":41.337,"end":41.835},{"w":"la","start":41.835,"end":42.021},{"w":"bellezza","start":42.021,"end":42.581},{"w":"adorna","start":42.581,"end":43.017},{"w":"la","start":43.017,"end":43.203},{"w":"virtù","start":43.203,"end":43.576}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"L'alloro e la palma ricordano l'emblema di Bernardo Bembo, un ambasciatore veneziano che mi scriveva.","start":44.026,"end":49.75,"words":[{"w":"L'alloro","start":44.026,"end":44.542},{"w":"e","start":44.542,"end":44.656},{"w":"la","start":44.656,"end":44.828},{"w":"palma","start":44.828,"end":45.171},{"w":"ricordano","start":45.171,"end":45.744},{"w":"l'emblema","start":45.744,"end":46.316},{"w":"di","start":46.316,"end":46.488},{"w":"Bernardo","start":46.488,"end":47.003},{"w":"Bembo","start":47.003,"end":47.346},{"w":"un","start":47.346,"end":47.518},{"w":"ambasciatore","start":47.518,"end":48.262},{"w":"veneziano","start":48.262,"end":48.834},{"w":"che","start":48.834,"end":49.063},{"w":"mi","start":49.063,"end":49.235},{"w":"scriveva","start":49.235,"end":49.75}],"paragraph":3},{"text":"Forse hai notato che il quadro sembra tagliato in basso.","start":50.65,"end":53.239,"words":[{"w":"Forse","start":50.65,"end":50.928},{"w":"hai","start":50.928,"end":51.112},{"w":"notato","start":51.112,"end":51.436},{"w":"che","start":51.436,"end":51.621},{"w":"il","start":51.621,"end":51.76},{"w":"quadro","start":51.76,"end":52.083},{"w":"sembra","start":52.083,"end":52.407},{"w":"tagliato","start":52.407,"end":52.823},{"w":"in","start":52.823,"end":52.962},{"w":"basso","start":52.962,"end":53.239}],"paragraph":4},{"text":"Un tempo la tavola era più lunga e probabilmente mostrava anche le mie mani, ma quella parte è andata perduta.","start":53.689,"end":59.947,"words":[{"w":"Un","start":53.689,"end":53.861},{"w":"tempo","start":53.861,"end":54.206},{"w":"la","start":54.206,"end":54.378},{"w":"tavola","start":54.378,"end":54.78},{"w":"era","start":54.78,"end":55.01},{"w":"più","start":55.01,"end":55.239},{"w":"lunga","start":55.239,"end":55.584},{"w":"e","start":55.584,"end":55.699},{"w":"probabilmente","start":55.699,"end":56.502},{"w":"mostrava","start":56.502,"end":57.019},{"w":"anche","start":57.019,"end":57.363},{"w":"le","start":57.363,"end":57.536},{"w":"mie","start":57.536,"end":57.765},{"w":"mani","start":57.765,"end":58.052},{"w":"ma","start":58.052,"end":58.225},{"w":"quella","start":58.225,"end":58.626},{"w":"parte","start":58.626,"end":58.971},{"w":"è","start":58.971,"end":59.086},{"w":"andata","start":59.086,"end":59.488},{"w":"perduta","start":59.488,"end":59.947}],"paragraph":4},{"text":"Oggi sono a Washington, nella National Gallery of Art, che mi ha acquistata nel 1967 dal principe del Liechtenstein.","start":60.847,"end":68.846,"words":[{"w":"Oggi","start":60.847,"end":61.198},{"w":"sono","start":61.198,"end":61.549},{"w":"a","start":61.549,"end":61.689},{"w":"Washington","start":61.689,"end":62.461},{"w":"nella","start":62.461,"end":62.882},{"w":"National","start":62.882,"end":63.513},{"w":"Gallery","start":63.513,"end":64.075},{"w":"of","start":64.075,"end":64.285},{"w":"Art","start":64.285,"end":64.566},{"w":"che","start":64.566,"end":64.847},{"w":"mi","start":64.847,"end":65.057},{"w":"ha","start":65.057,"end":65.268},{"w":"acquistata","start":65.268,"end":66.039},{"w":"nel","start":66.039,"end":66.32},{"w":"1967","start":66.32,"end":66.671},{"w":"dal","start":66.671,"end":66.952},{"w":"principe","start":66.952,"end":67.583},{"w":"del","start":67.583,"end":67.864},{"w":"Liechtenstein","start":67.864,"end":68.846}],"paragraph":5},{"text":"Se vuoi, fammi una domanda.","start":69.746,"end":71.592,"words":[{"w":"Se","start":69.746,"end":69.959},{"w":"vuoi","start":69.959,"end":70.314},{"w":"fammi","start":70.314,"end":70.74},{"w":"una","start":70.74,"end":71.024},{"w":"domanda","start":71.024,"end":71.592}],"paragraph":6}]}